@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-58 - View User Detail

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Users UI" as FE
control "AuthController" as API
control "UsersService" as Service
database "MongoDB: users, role" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-58
FE -> API: GET /auth/users/:id
API -> Service: Execute View User Detail
Service -> DB: Read/write users, role
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Chi tiết user hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: User tồn tại
Post: Chi tiết user hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin click vào user
2. System gọi API GET /auth/users/:userId
3. System trả về: username, email, fullName, phone, role, addresses,\ncreatedAt, orderCount
end note
@enduml
